              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Sulemaani hamwe n'omutwe gwona ogw'abantu baaza Gibeoni omu mwanya, mukuru gw'okuramizamu; ahabw'okuba niyo Eihema rya Ruhanga ry'okubugaabuganiramu, eri Musa omwiru wa MUKAMA yaakozire omu ihamba, ryabaire riri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
