            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.13.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 13:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu MUKAMA Ruhanga, eki waaraganiise tata Daudi kihikiirizibwe; ahakuba ongizire omugabe w'abantu abarikwingana omucuucu gw'aha nsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 27:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo hati ninkushaba obwengye n'okwetegyereza oku ndaagume nintwaza omu maisho g'aba bantu omu kushohora n'omu kutaaha; ahatari ekyo, n'oha orikubaasa kutegyeka abantu baawe aba abarikwingana bati? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga yaamugira ati: Ahabw'okuba ekyo nikyo kibairi kikuri aha mutima, kandi tiwaayeshabira bintu, nari obutungi, nari ekitiinisa, nari okushabira abazigu baawe kufa, n'obu kwakuba okweshabire okuramaara, kureka waayeshabira obwengye n'okwetegyereza, ngu obone kutegyeka abantu bangye, abu nkwemekyeire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbwenu obwengye n'okwetegyereza waabiheebwa, kandi ndyakuha obutungi, ebintu n'ekitiinisa, ebitakagirwaga mugabe weena omu baakubandiize, kandi n'omu barikukurata tihaine oribigira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Sulemaani yaaruga Gibeoni omu maisho g'eihema ry'okubugaabuganiramu, eryabaire riri omu mwanya mukuru gw'okuramizamu, yaagaruka Yerusaalemu; yaategyeka Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
