              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Embaraasi ezi Sulemaani yaabaire atungire, bakaba baziiha Misri; abashuubuzi b'omugabe bakaba bazigura omu busyo, buri busyo bwine obuguzi bwabwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
